    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42116" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γους</span></b> 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς εὐωχίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
			</span></i> Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.433
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.50
			</span></i> ; <i>beg one's bread</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				48.517
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>). </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>assist by contributions,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλούς</span> codd.) <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.2.12
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτους</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οις</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.635
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be so assisted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρανισθεὶς πρὸς τῶν φίλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					8.87
				</span></i>
			. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of <i>'log-rolling',</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ οἷς -ίζει τοῖς περὶ αὑτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					39.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
